<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: EGO inhibitor -->
  <OE_EGOInhibitor.label>EGO抑制器</OE_EGOInhibitor.label>
  <!-- EN: A device that emits a specially tuned field which numbs the neural activity of captured entities. Uses the EGO seed as a catalyst. As long as it is powered, it improves the containment strength of any holding platform that it is pointed at. The electric field does not affect humans or normal animals. -->
  <OE_EGOInhibitor.description>一种发射特殊调谐场的装置，能够麻痹被捕获实体的神经活动。使用EGO种子作为催化剂。只要通电，它就能提高所指向的任何拘束平台的收容强度。电场不会影响人类或普通动物。</OE_EGOInhibitor.description>
  
  <!-- EN: obsidia holding platform -->
  <OE_HoldingPlatform.label>黑曜石拘束平台</OE_HoldingPlatform.label>
  <!-- EN: An obsidia heavy platform for holding dangerous entities. The corners have eyelets where strong chains can be attached.\n\nDowned entities can be captured and secured on a holding platform, where they can be studied for Anomaly knowledge. Increase containment strength by building strong walls and doors, and other special containment devices.\n\nContainment efficiency is 125%. -->
  <OE_HoldingPlatform.description>用于拘束危险实体的黑曜石重型平台。角落有眼环，可以附上粗链。\n\n被击倒的实体可以被捕获并固定在拘束平台上，在那里可以研究异常知识。通过建造坚固的墙壁和门以及其他特殊收容装置来提高收容强度。\n\n收容效率为125%。</OE_HoldingPlatform.description>
  
</LanguageData>